{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>YHWH is a man of war.</b> For He upholds His loved ones who cleave to Him, and He is a man of war against their enemies." "The meaning of איש is as the essence of the thing. Now, concerning the stars, איש is not absent (Isaiah 40:26); concerning living creatures, \"each goes toward its face\" (Ezekiel 1:9); concerning angels, \"and the man Gabriel\" (Daniel 9:21). And behold, איש מלחמה is like בעל מלחמה, like איש אמונים (Proverbs 20:6) — a man in whom faithfulness resides." "<b>YHWH is His name.</b> Now He makes His name known, like the one who calls to the waters of the sea — HaShem is His name (Amos 8:5) — He alone who does thus."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:37.983191924Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}